1026 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Python is a high-level programming language known for its readability and simplicity in implementation. Being open-source, Python is freely available for both personal and commercial use.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
1027 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Its built-in data structures, dynamic typing, and dynamic binding facilitate rapid application development and scripting. Python's user-friendly syntax prioritizes readability, which lowers maintenance costs.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
1028 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Additionally, Python supports modules and packages to promote code modularity and reuse, enhancing efficiency in software development.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [4]
>>
